\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(I,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (club predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-club.md\">../batch20/58-df-club.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\">\\(\\operatorname{cf}:V\\to V\\)</span> (cofinality function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md\">../batch13/58-df-cofinality.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{OrderType}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (order-type predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" href=\"?note=5d2cd56a38a81b7a\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-order-type.md\">../batch11/58-df-order-type.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land I=\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:\\begin{array}{l}\\exists\\vec a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec a(\\xi)\\subseteq\\xi\\land|\\vec a(\\xi)|&lt;\\kappa)\\\\[2pt]\\land\\;\\forall\\delta\\in A\\cap C\\;\\exists c\\subseteq\\delta\\;(\\sup c=\\delta\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta),c,\\in\\cap c^2)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;(c\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\xi)))\\bigr)\\end{array}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}approachability\\text{-}ideal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ApproachabilityIdeal}_S(I,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)=\\kappa\\land I=\\left\\{A\\subseteq\\kappa:\\begin{array}{l}\\exists\\vec a\\in\\mathcal P(\\kappa)^\\kappa\\;\\exists C\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Club}(C,\\kappa)\\land\\forall\\xi\\in\\kappa\\;(\\vec a(\\xi)\\subseteq\\xi\\land|\\vec a(\\xi)|&lt;\\kappa)\\\\[2pt]\\land\\;\\forall\\delta\\in A\\cap C\\;\\exists c\\subseteq\\delta\\;(\\sup c=\\delta\\land\\mathrm{OrderType}_S(\\operatorname{cf}(\\delta),c,\\in\\cap c^2)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\delta\\;\\exists\\xi\\in\\delta\\;(c\\cap\\beta=\\vec a(\\xi)))\\bigr)\\end{array}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary ZFC definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targe